{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664120/extras/dc71a0ccd3ca3ddaca4b22fa278239c7.avif?t=1750411717\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN UNKNOWN THREAT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown threat has unearthed from an abandoned planet and millions of bug-like creatures have begun an all out assault on the entire solar system. The situation seemed desperate until a mysterious drill shuttle began charging towards the planet. A new hope perhaps? Descent into the depths of the planet, rescue the trapped soldiers, destroy the source of the threat and don't get consumed by the noise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBRACE THE CHAOS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ULTRA CORE DIVE</strong> is a dark and chaotic arcade twinstick shooter inspired by the masters of the genre. The game features a dark retro inspired pseudo-1bit aesthetic with tons of action on screen. The gameplay is familiar fast-paced twinstick shooter action with a small learning curve, complimented with a tough-as-nails difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot and dodge your way through  5 Zones, featuring 50 handcrafted Arenas filled with waves-and-waves of enemies and hazards! Fight huge and brutal BOSSES that fill the screen with bullets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up and equip powerful weapons and abilities with a semi-randomized upgrade system! Be the arcade master and rack up  score multipliers and bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get consumed by the noise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLASHING WARNING!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features frequently flashing on screen effects that photosensitive and/or epileptic may find discomforting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewer discretion is adviced!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"HARD EXT.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664120/c27473a1a1a8a8788df197d4dba1ca414196ce88.jpg"},{"name":"ANCIENT FOSSIL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664120/fdd74091556ded3c9e4f975c054ccf7ab452051c.jpg"},{"name":"THE BULLY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664120/a00d64c55fcd31b454994a01ace61d1e87187126.jpg"},{"name":"NOID NIHIL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664120/814c8489af349d2ffbee2e68dd2d550598a95ee1.jpg"},{"name":"END","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664120/8f215f8f1452faefa4cbb743dda6e63d7b484c6d.jpg"},{"name":"DAWN OF A NEW ERA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664120/de80e23d74045a98920ff1a9c8ffaffb9384431e.jpg"},{"name":"FIND A VIP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664120/734e1be052e3f0477e1478241eecf73be25018f2.jpg"},{"name":"10K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664120/79d608df651cd9b895b44105c45812234ecf7a9a.jpg"},{"name":"PLASMA CITY!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664120/50d89d1fed4662b2542369fea3fd1da55e9cadb5.jpg"},{"name":"PLASMA METROPOLIS!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664120/c0fe6730cd1c8ccd5107a20c7522c49dc63063e8.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664120?t=1750411717","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664120?t=1750411717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a